# BLoC rules

- Immutable events/states with `Equatable` or sealed classes.
- No business logic in widgets — dispatch events / call cubit methods.
- Use `BlocBuilder` / `BlocListener` / `BlocConsumer` appropriately; avoid rebuilding large trees.
- Prefer Cubit for simple local UI state with few intents.
- Every new Bloc/Cubit ships with `bloc_test` coverage.
